{"seq":4,"slug":"lc0087-scramble-string","title":"LeetCode 87 扰乱字符串","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/hard-dp-advanced/lc0087-scramble-string","wordCount":703,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-87-扰乱字符串\">LeetCode 87 扰乱字符串</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>使用以下算法可以<strong>扰乱</strong>字符串 <code>s</code> 得到字符串 <code>t</code>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>如果字符串长度为 1，停止</li>\n<li>如果字符串长度 &gt; 1，执行以下步骤：<ul>\n<li>在一个随机位置将字符串分为两个非空子串</li>\n<li><strong>随机决定</strong>是「交换两个子串」还是「保持原序」</li>\n<li>对两个子串<strong>递归</strong>执行同样的操作</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>给定两个<strong>长度相同</strong>的字符串 <code>s1</code> 和 <code>s2</code>，判断 <code>s2</code> 是否是 <code>s1</code> 的扰乱字符串。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>s1.length == s2.length</code></li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= s1.length &lt;= 30</code></li>\n<li><code>s1</code> 和 <code>s2</code> 由小写英文字母组成</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s1 = &quot;great&quot;, s2 = &quot;rgeat&quot;&#10;输出：true&#10;解释：great → gr|eat → rg|eat → rgeat（在位置 2 分割，交换前两个字符）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s1 = \"great\", s2 = \"rgeat\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：great → gr|eat → rg|eat → rgeat（在位置 2 分割，交换前两个字符）</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s1 = &quot;abcde&quot;, s2 = &quot;caebd&quot;&#10;输出：false\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s1 = \"abcde\", s2 = \"caebd\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：false</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：s1 = &quot;a&quot;, s2 = &quot;a&quot;&#10;输出：true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：s1 = \"a\", s2 = \"a\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：true</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是一道经典的<strong>区间 DP / 记忆化搜索</strong>问题。</p>\n<p><strong>递归分析：</strong> 如果 <code>s2</code> 是 <code>s1</code> 的扰乱字符串，那么存在某个分割点 <code>k</code>（1 ≤ k &lt; n），将 <code>s1</code> 分为 <code>s1[0..k-1]</code> 和 <code>s1[k..n-1]</code> 两部分，使得以下两种情况之一成立：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>不交换</strong>：<code>s2[0..k-1]</code> 是 <code>s1[0..k-1]</code> 的扰乱串，且 <code>s2[k..n-1]</code> 是 <code>s1[k..n-1]</code> 的扰乱串</li>\n<li><strong>交换</strong>：<code>s2[0..n-k-1]</code> 是 <code>s1[k..n-1]</code> 的扰乱串，且 <code>s2[n-k..n-1]</code> 是 <code>s1[0..k-1]</code> 的扰乱串</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>剪枝优化：</strong> 在递归之前，先检查两个子串的字符频率是否相同。如果不同，直接返回 false。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;isScramble(s1, s2)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B{s1 == s2?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[返回 true]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{字符频率相同?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[返回 false]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[&quot;枚举分割点 k&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;不交换: 左对左, 右对右&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;交换: 左对右, 右对左&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I{递归结果}&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    I --&gt;|任一为 true| J[返回 true]&#10;    I --&gt;|全为 false| K[返回 false]\">graph TD\n    A[\"isScramble(s1, s2)\"]\n    A --&gt; B{s1 == s2?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[返回 true]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{字符频率相同?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[返回 false]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[\"枚举分割点 k\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"不交换: 左对左, 右对右\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"交换: 左对右, 右对左\"]\n    G --&gt; I{递归结果}\n    H --&gt; I\n    I --&gt;|任一为 true| J[返回 true]\n    I --&gt;|全为 false| K[返回 false]</pre><p><strong>方法一：记忆化递归</strong></p>\n<p>用 <code>Map&lt;string, boolean&gt;</code> 缓存 <code>(s1子串, s2子串)</code> 的结果，避免重复计算。</p>\n<p><strong>方法二：三维 DP</strong></p>\n<p>定义 <code>dp[i][j][len]</code> 为 <code>s1</code> 从位置 <code>i</code> 开始、<code>s2</code> 从位置 <code>j</code> 开始、长度为 <code>len</code> 的子串是否互为扰乱串。</p>\n<p>状态转移：枚举分割长度 <code>k</code>（1 ≤ k &lt; len），检查不交换和交换两种情况。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力递归</td>\n<td>指数级</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆化递归</td>\n<td>O(n⁴)</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n<td>代码简洁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三维 DP</td>\n<td>O(n⁴)</td>\n<td>O(n³)</td>\n<td>自底向上</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>记忆化递归：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function isScramble(s1: string, s2: string): boolean {&#10;  const memo: Map&lt;string, boolean&gt; = new Map();&#10;&#10;  const check = (a: string, b: string): boolean =&gt; {&#10;    if (a === b) return true;&#10;    if (a.length !== b.length) return false;&#10;&#10;    const key = `${a}#${b}`;&#10;    if (memo.has(key)) return memo.get(key)!;&#10;&#10;    const freq = new Array(26).fill(0);&#10;    for (let i = 0; i &lt; a.length; i++) {&#10;      freq[a.charCodeAt(i) - 97]++;&#10;      freq[b.charCodeAt(i) - 97]--;&#10;    }&#10;    if (freq.some((f) =&gt; f !== 0)) {&#10;      memo.set(key, false);&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    const n = a.length;&#10;    for (let k = 1; k &lt; n; k++) {&#10;      if (&#10;        (check(a.slice(0, k), b.slice(0, k)) &amp;&amp; check(a.slice(k), b.slice(k))) ||&#10;        (check(a.slice(0, k), b.slice(n - k)) &amp;&amp; check(a.slice(k), b.slice(0, n - k)))&#10;      ) {&#10;        memo.set(key, true);&#10;        return true;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    memo.set(key, false);&#10;    return false;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return check(s1, s2);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> isScramble</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">s2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> memo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (a.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">a</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}#${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (memo.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> memo.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> freq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">26</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color